    {"ID": 394, "Category": "Technology", "Specialty": "IT", "Difficulty": "Medium", "Question": "What does DHCP stand for and what is its purpose?", "Answer": "DHCP (Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol) automatically assigns dynamic IP addresses to network devices, allowing them to obtain a new IP address each time they connect to the network."},
